; MesCC uses 256 MiB PER ARENA: 512 MiB total object space, unchanged from the
; previous single-arena profile, plus 256 MiB owners and a 128 MiB mark queue.
; Separate large-block space protects buffers from small-object fragmentation.
; GcMemoryBytes sizes ELF BSS. Semantic fixtures use 2 MiB per arena.
(Rule (GcHeapBytes) (X8 1 0 0 0 0 0 0 0))
